<title>USA: ACC gets 1.81 mln ACC Tel shrs tendered.</title>
<headline>ACC gets 1.81 mln ACC Tel shrs tendered.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACC Corp said Monday that 1,811,328 common shares of ACC Tel were tendered before the offer expired October 18.</p>
<p>ACC Corp, which intends to make ACC Tel a subsidiary, said the figure represents about 80 percent of the outstanding ACC Tel common shares it doesn't already own.</p>
<p>ACC Corp said it owned about 70 percent of ACC Tel common before the offer and intends to buy remaining common shares of ACC Tel.</p>
</text>
